    $("#smartolt-config").onclick=()=>modal("Conectar SmartOLT",`<div class="notice info">El token se cifra en el servidor y nunca se guarda en el navegador.</div><div class="field" style="margin-top:14px"><label>Subdominio</label><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><input class="input" name="subdomain" value="${esc(status.subdomain||"")}" placeholder="miisp"><span class="muted">.smartolt.com</span></div></div><div class="field"><label>API Token</label><input class="input mono" type="password" name="api_key" required></div>`,async fd=>{await D.api("isp_configure_smartolt",{organization_id:oid,subdomain:formVal(fd,"subdomain"),api_key:formVal(fd,"api_key")});await renderSmartOLT(oid)},{submitLabel:"Guardar conexión"});
